{"ref":"BDB, אֱנוֹשׁ","hw":"אֱנוֹשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֱנוֹשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 15:14\" href=\"/Job.15.14\">Jb 15:14</a></sup> <strong>man, mankind</strong>, mostly poet. (18 times Jb, 13 times ψ, etc.) <strong>(</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أُنَاسٌ</span> (coll.), Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱנָשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐ݈݇ܢܳܫܳܐ</span> (coll.), Nab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אנוש</span>, Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">אנש</span>, Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אנס</span> DHM<sup>ZMG 1883, 330</sup>, also Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">نَاسٌ</span>, Assyrian <em>nišu</em>, <em>people</em>, & cf. <em>tenišêtu</em>, <em>humanity, human race</em>, v. COT<sup>Gloss.</sup> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, אנשׁ\" href=\"/BDB,_אנשׁ\", dir=\"rtl\">אנשׁ</a> & <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׁ</span> & Hpt<sup>KAT 2 497</sup><strong>)</strong>—abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.1\">Is 8:1</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.10\">Je 20:10</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of individ. <a data-ref=\"Job 5:17\" href=\"/Job.5.17\">Jb 5:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:9\" href=\"/Job.13.9\">13:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:14\" href=\"/Psalms.55.14\">ψ 55:14</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.12\">Is 13:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.2\">56:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־אדם</span>); <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.10\">Je 20:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ שְׁלֹמִי</span> <em>man of my peace</em>, i.e. my friend.<br><strong>2.</strong>  coll. <em>men</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.6\">Is 24:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.8\">33:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.7\">51:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:12\" href=\"/Psalms.66.12\">ψ 66:12</a>; = men in general, ordinary men <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:5\" href=\"/Psalms.73.5\">ψ 73:5</a> cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶט א׳</span> i.e. a common stylus <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.1\">Is 8:1</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אִישׁ\" href=\"/BDB,_אִישׁ\", dir=\"rtl\">אַמַּת אִישׁ</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.11\">Dt 3:11</a>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>man, mankind</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.26\">Dt 32:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 7:1\" href=\"/Job.7.1\">Jb 7:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:19\" href=\"/Job.14.19\">14:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 28:4\" href=\"/Job.28.4\">28:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 28:13\" href=\"/Job.28.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 32:8\" href=\"/Job.32.8\">32:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 33:26\" href=\"/Job.33.26\">33:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 36:25\" href=\"/Job.36.25\">36:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנָשִׁים</span> v <a data-ref=\"Job 36:24\" href=\"/Job.36.24\">24</a>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 56:2\" href=\"/Psalms.56.2\">ψ 56:2</a>; especially opp. God <a data-ref=\"Job 4:17\" href=\"/Job.4.17\">Jb 4:17</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּבֶר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 7:17\" href=\"/Job.7.17\">7:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 9:2\" href=\"/Job.9.2\">9:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 10:4\" href=\"/Job.10.4\">10:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 10:5\" href=\"/Job.10.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 15:14\" href=\"/Job.15.14\">15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 25:4\" href=\"/Job.25.4\">25:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 33:12\" href=\"/Job.33.12\">33:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.10\">2 Ch 14:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:5\" href=\"/Psalms.8.5\">ψ 8:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־אָדָם</span>) so <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.12\">Is 51:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:20\" href=\"/Psalms.9.20\">ψ 9:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:21\" href=\"/Psalms.9.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:3\" href=\"/Psalms.90.3\">90:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי־אָדָם</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:15\" href=\"/Psalms.103.15\">103:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:3\" href=\"/Psalms.144.3\">144:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם</span>); cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי־א׳ רִמָּה וּבֶן־אָדָם תּוֹלֵעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 25:6\" href=\"/Job.25.6\">Jb 25:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מִן־הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:18\" href=\"/Psalms.10.18\">ψ 10:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־לְבַב א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.7\">Is 13:7</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:15\" href=\"/Psalms.104.15\">ψ 104:15</a><sup>(×2)</sup>. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנָשִׁים</span> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אישׁ\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אישׁ\">אִושׁ</a> (p. 35).","next":"BDB, אֱנוֹשׁ²","prev":"BDB, אנשׁ"}